# predicate/

Core system for evaluating predicates against items through pipelines and loops, with caching, resolution, and a DSL for defining reusable processing chains.

## Dirs

- `dsl/` -- DSL macro expansion, evaluator, and .pred file loader

## Files

- `item.ex` -- Item struct: field data, tags, and metadata
- `predicate.ex` -- Core predicate interface and evaluation with caching
- `loop.ex` -- Loop struct: collection of predicates with ORed matching
- `pipeline.ex` -- Pipeline struct: sequence of loops with ANDed filtering
- `pipeline_config.ex` -- PipelineConfig behaviour for configuration modules
- `resolver.ex` -- Resolution path for predicate/loop/pipeline references and hydration
- `registry.ex` -- GenServer registry for compile-time and runtime definitions
- `default_pipeline_config.ex` -- Standard PipelineConfig implementation via macro
- `cache.ex` -- ETS-based caching for predicate evaluation results
- `coerce.ex` -- Strict type coercion contract for numbers and booleans
- `standard_lib.ex` -- Standard predicate library with Text comparison submodule
